{"id":"573e015d328ead90","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-measure10-completion-of-measure.md","title":"ZFC Measure10 Completion Of Measure","display":"df-zfc-measure10-completion-of-measure — ZFC Measure10 Completion Of Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure10-completion-of-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure10-completion-of-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-measure10-completion-of-measure — ZFC Measure10 Completion Of Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure10-completion-of-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure10-completion-of-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure10-completion-of-measure — ZFC Measure10 Completion Of Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\">\\((X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\)</span> (measure space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\Sigma\">\\(\\widehat\\Sigma\\)</span> (completed <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\mu\">\\(\\widehat\\mu\\)</span> (completed measure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\)</span> (measure-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\)</span> (sigma-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MeasureCompletion}\">\\(\\operatorname{MeasureCompletion}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}completion\\text{-}of\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\operatorname{MeasureCompletion}(\\widehat\\Sigma,\\widehat\\mu,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\widehat\\Sigma,\\widehat\\mu)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(A\\in\\widehat\\Sigma\\leftrightarrow\\exists B,N\\in\\Sigma\\;(((A\\setminus B)\\cup(B\\setminus A))\\subseteq N\\land\\mu(N)=0)\\Bigr)\\land\\forall A\\in\\widehat\\Sigma\\;\\forall B\\in\\Sigma\\;\\Bigl((\\exists N\\in\\Sigma\\;(((A\\setminus B)\\cup(B\\setminus A))\\subseteq N\\land\\mu(N)=0))\\to\\widehat\\mu(A)=\\mu(B)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}completion\\text{-}of\\text{-}measure} \\vdash \\operatorname{MeasureCompletion}(\\widehat\\Sigma,\\widehat\\mu,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\widehat\\Sigma,\\widehat\\mu)\\land\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(A\\in\\widehat\\Sigma\\leftrightarrow\\exists B,N\\in\\Sigma\\;(((A\\setminus B)\\cup(B\\setminus A))\\subseteq N\\land\\mu(N)=0)\\Bigr)\\land\\forall A\\in\\widehat\\Sigma\\;\\forall B\\in\\Sigma\\;\\Bigl((\\exists N\\in\\Sigma\\;(((A\\setminus B)\\cup(B\\setminus A))\\subseteq N\\land\\mu(N)=0))\\to\\widehat\\mu(A)=\\mu(B)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both triples are required to be measure spaces; the equivalence describes the completed sigma-algebra and the final clause fixes the unique extended measure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-measure-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3